      "text": "MOFA 的输入描述允许多个组学数据矩阵来自相同或重叠的样本集合，因此“相同细胞且已验证 ID”这一对应关系落在其描述范围内。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Given several data matrices with measurements of multiple -omics data types on the same or on overlapping sets of samples, MOFA infers an interpretable low-dimensional representation in terms of a few latent factors ."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "该描述没有定义任意缺失模态的通用兼容性规则，因此不能仅凭“相同细胞”就推断 RNA 与 ATAC 两个 view 在任意缺失或重叠模式下都满足要求。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
